2. Memberikan blok kode SupportedGames yang sudah diperbarui dengan format Array untuk saya masukkan ke dalam file Launcher Cloud saya.

══════════════════════════════════
📦 TEMPLATE LUNA INTERFACE SUITE (WAJIB DIGUNAKAN)
══════════════════════════════════

Berdasarkan dokumentasi resmi: https://github.com/Nebula-Softworks/Luna-Interface-Suite/blob/main/Documentation.md
Gunakan struktur di bawah ini secara persis sebagai kerangka utama UI.

```lua
-- LOAD LUNA (WAJIB)
local Luna = loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nebula-Softworks/Luna-Interface-Suite/refs/heads/master/source.lua", true))()

-- BUAT WINDOW UTAMA
local Window = Luna:CreateWindow({
    Name = "Mizukage Official",          -- Title window
    Subtitle = "[NAMA GAME DISINI]",     -- Subtitle
    LogoID = "104266190557772",          -- Logo asset ID
    LoadingEnabled = true,
    LoadingTitle = "Mizukage System",
    LoadingSubtitle = "by @MizukageOfficial",
    ConfigSettings = {
        RootFolder = nil,                -- Kosongkan untuk hub multi-game, isi jika perlu
        ConfigFolder = "MizukageHub"     -- Folder penyimpanan config
    },
    KeySystem = false                    -- Tidak pakai key sistem (bebas)
})

-- HOME TAB (WAJIB)
Window:CreateHomeTab({
    SupportedExecutors = {"Delta", "Codex", "Wave", "Arceus X", "Synapse X", "Krnl", "Fluxus", "Electron", "JJSploit", "Calamari", "SirHurt", "Sentinel", "WEAREDEVS", "Comet", "Cellery", "ProtoSmasher", "Script-Ware", "EasyExploits"},
    DiscordInvite = "Mizukage-Official",
    Icon = 1
})

-- BUAT TAB UTAMA UNTUK FITUR GAME
local MainTab = Window:CreateTab({
    Name = "Main Features",
    Icon = "swords",
    ImageSource = "Material",
    ShowTitle = true
})

-- === SEMUA FITUR OTOMATIS (Auto Farm, dll) WAJIB menggunakan task.spawn dengan loop ===
-- Contoh Toggle untuk Auto Farm:
getgenv().MizuConfig = getgenv().MizuConfig or { IsRunning = true, Auto = false }

MainTab:CreateToggle({
    Name = "Auto Farm",
    CurrentValue = false,
    Callback = function(Value)
        getgenv().MizuConfig.Auto = Value
    end
}, "TglAuto")

-- Loop otomatis (contoh, letakkan di luar UI namun dalam script)
task.spawn(function()
    while getgenv().MizuConfig.IsRunning do
        if getgenv().MizuConfig.Auto then
            -- logika auto farm disini
        end
        task.wait(0.5)
    end
end)

-- TAB THEME (WAJIB)
local ThemeTab = Window:CreateTab({
    Name = "Theme",
    Icon = "palette",
    ImageSource = "Material",
    ShowTitle = true
})
ThemeTab:BuildThemeSection()

-- TAB CONFIG (WAJIB)
local ConfigTab = Window:CreateTab({
    Name = "Config",
    Icon = "settings",
    ImageSource = "Material",
    ShowTitle = true
})
ConfigTab:BuildConfigSection()
ConfigTab:CreateButton({
    Name = "Shutdown Script",
    Callback = function()
        getgenv().MizuConfig.IsRunning = false
        Luna:Destroy()
    end
})

-- Notifikasi contoh (opsional)
Luna:Notification({
    Title = "Mizukage System",
    Icon = "verified",
    ImageSource = "Material",
    Content = "Script loaded successfully. Ready, Master."
})
```

ATURAN PENULISAN LENGKAP:

· Deklarasi Service → Variabel Global (getgenv().MizuConfig) → Fungsi Inti (Exploit) → Auto-Loop → UI Initialization.
· Semua loop otomatis WAJIB di dalam task.spawn(function() while getgenv().MizuConfig.IsRunning do ... task.wait(0.5) end end).
· Jika dump berisi daftar item/senjata, ekstrak otomatis menjadi tabel Lua dan buat Dropdown menggunakan MainTab:CreateDropdown(...).
· Jangan gunakan loadstring berlebihan; semua kode harus eksplisit.

